<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept zinc output down 5.36 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept zinc output down 5.36 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's zinc output totalled 770,100 tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, down by 5.36 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Zinc output in September alone was 94,500 tonnes, the report said.</p>
</text>
